@startuml DevelopmentView_Consistency

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam noteBorderColor gray
skinparam noteBackgroundColor lightyellow

' Define views
component "Development View" as DevV #LightGray
component "Functional View" as FV #LightGreen
component "Information View" as IV #LightPink
component "Deployment View" as DV #LightBlue
component "Operational View" as OV #Gold

' Layout
left to right direction

' Links and notes
DevV -- FV : "supports decomposition"
note on link
    - Module structure must reflect functional elements.  
    - Code must align with system function organization.  
    - Helps locate and update related logic.
end note

DevV -- IV : "aligns with data models"
note on link
    - Repositories must support data flows and structures.  
    - Persistence logic must enforce integrity constraints.
end note

DevV -- DV : "produces deployable artifacts"
note on link
    - Builds must match target environment (e.g., Docker).  
end note

DevV -- OV : "enables monitoring"
note on link
    - Logging and instrumentation must support observability.  
    - DevView must expose runtime insights required by Ops.
end note

@enduml
